This Terraform configuration sets up the required AWS infrastructure for deploying a web application, including IAM roles, a VPC with an Internet Gateway, subnets, route configurations, an RDS instance, and an Elastic Beanstalk environment. The configuration ensures that all resources are properly linked and dependencies are respected.

