### Description
The Terraform program below sets up a basic Amazon Kinesis Analytics Application with an input Kinesis stream. It includes the creation of an IAM role and policy necessary for the Kinesis Analytics Application to access the Kinesis stream. The resources are defined in a way that respects the dependencies specified in the IaC Intent Graph IR.

### Terraform HCL Program
```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"  # Specify your desired AWS region
}

resource "aws_kinesis_stream" "kinesis_input_stream" {
  name        = "kinesis-input-stream"
  shard_count = 1
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "kinesis_analytics_role" {
  name = "kinesis-analytics-role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Action = "sts:AssumeRole"
        Effect = "Allow"
        Principal = {
          Service = "kinesisanalytics.amazonaws.com"
        }
      }
    ]
  })
}

resource "aws_iam_role_policy" "kinesis_analytics_policy" {
  name   = "kinesis-analytics-policy"
  role   = aws_iam_role.kinesis_analytics_role.id
  policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Action = [
          "kinesis:GetRecords",
          "kinesis:GetShardIterator",
          "kinesis:DescribeStream",
          "kinesis:ListStreams"
        ]
        Effect = "Allow"
        Resource = aws_kinesis_stream.kinesis_input_stream.arn
      }
    ]
  })
}

resource "aws_kinesis_analytics_application" "kinesis_analytics_app" {
  name = "kinesis-analytics-app"

  inputs {
    name_prefix = "input_stream"

    kinesis_stream_source_configuration {
      kinesis_stream_arn = aws_kinesis_stream.kinesis_input_stream.arn
      role_arn           = aws_iam_role.kinesis_analytics_role.arn
    }
  }
}
```

This Terraform configuration creates:
1. An AWS Kinesis Stream named `kinesis-input-stream`.
2. An IAM Role named `kinesis-analytics-role` with a trust policy allowing Kinesis Analytics to assume it.
3. An IAM Policy named `kinesis-analytics-policy` attached to the IAM Role, granting permissions for Kinesis Analytics to read from the Kinesis stream.
4. A Kinesis Analytics Application named `kinesis-analytics-app` configured to use the Kinesis stream as its input source.

Make sure to replace `"us-west-2"` with your desired AWS region if necessary.

