LLM Output #0:
### Description
The Terraform program below creates an AWS Application Load Balancer (ALB) with an IP target group. The ALB listens on port 80 and forwards traffic to the IP target group. The necessary dependencies and security configurations are included to ensure proper deployment.

### Terraform HCL Program
```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

variable "vpc_id" {
  description = "The ID of the VPC where the load balancer and target group will be created"
  type        = string
}

variable "subnets" {
  description = "A list of subnet IDs where the load balancer will be deployed"
  type        = list(string)
}

variable "security_group_ids" {
  description = "A list of security group IDs for the load balancer"
  type        = list(string)
}

resource "aws_lb" "load_balancer" {
  name               = "my-application-load-balancer"
  internal           = false
  load_balancer_type = "application"
  subnets            = var.subnets
  security_groups    = var.security_group_ids
}

resource "aws_lb_target_group" "ip_target_group" {
  name     = "my-ip-target-group"
  port     = 80
  protocol = "HTTP"
  vpc_id   = var.vpc_id
  target_type = "ip"
}

resource "aws_lb_listener" "listener" {
  load_balancer_arn = aws_lb.load_balancer.arn
  port              = "80"
  protocol          = "HTTP"

  default_action {
    type             = "forward"
    target_group_arn = aws_lb_target_group.ip_target_group.arn
  }
}
```

### Explanation
- **Provider Configuration**: The AWS provider is configured to use the `us-west-2` region.
- **Variables**: Three variables are defined:
  - `vpc_id`: The ID of the VPC where the load balancer and target group will be created.
  - `subnets`: A list of subnet IDs where the load balancer will be deployed.
  - `security_group_ids`: A list of security group IDs for the load balancer.
- **Load Balancer (`aws_lb`)**: An application load balancer is created with the specified subnets and security groups.
- **Target Group (`aws_lb_target_group`)**: An IP target group is created, associated with the specified VPC.
- **Listener (`aws_lb_listener`)**: A listener is created on port 80, forwarding traffic to the IP target group.

This configuration ensures that the load balancer, target group, and listener are properly set up and interconnected.

